 "posts": [
  "POWER RESTORATION UPDATE\nAffected Areas: Portion of MF6 - Portion along Prk. Bayabasan, Brgy. Bata, Bacolod City.\nRestored at 2:00 PM\nOur dedicated team has successfully restored power to the affected areas.\nWe sincerely thank our valued consumers for your patience and continued support throughout the restoration process.\nIf you are still experiencing a power outage, kindly send us your account details and contact number so we can assist you as soon as possible.\nThank you for your patience and understanding.",
  "SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION: NOVEMBER 5, 2026\nGinapahibalo sang Negros Power ang mga konsumidores nga may ara sang natalana nga power interruption sa NOVEMBER 5, 2026 (Thursday).\nIni kabahin sang 5-year rehabilitation kag modernization plan sang Negros Power agud malikawan ang mga wala ginalauman kag mas lapnagon nga power interruptions kag mangin reliable ang distribution system sang aton elektrisidad.\nYari ang mga detalye sang scheduled power interruption:\nDate: November 5, 2026 (Thursday)\nReason: Replacement of one 30ft. dilapidated wood pole into one 40ft. steel pole and removal of one 30ft. Dilapidated wooden pole and transfer its attachments to adjacent secondary steel pole.\nTime & Affected Areas:\n8:00AM to 5:00PM\nPortion of MF6 - Portion along Prk. Bayabasan, Brgy. Bata, Bacolod City.\nMadamo gid nga salamat sa inyo nga pag hangop.\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService"
 ],
